          </text>
          <text id="consumption-milk-label">
            <value>Within the past 7 days, did any members of your household drink any MILK within the household?</value>
            <value form="markdown">Within the past 7 days, did any members of your household drink any MILK within the household?</value>
          </text>
          <text id="consumption-sachet_water-label">
            <value>Within the past 7 days, did any members of your household drink any SACHET WATER within the household?</value>
            <value form="markdown">Within the past 7 days, did any members of your household drink any SACHET WATER within the household?</value>
          </text>
          <text id="electricity_screen-label">
            <value>Electricity</value>
            <value form="markdown">Electricity</value>
          </text>
          <text id="electricity_screen-electricity-label">
            <value>Over the past 30 days, did your household purchase or pay for any ELECTRICITY (including electricity vouchers)?</value>
            <value form="markdown">Over the past 30 days, did your household purchase or pay for any ELECTRICITY (including electricity vouchers)?</value>
          </text>
          <text id="electricity_screen-electricity-help">
            <value>Past 30 days means the month before today. If today is 20 August, that means anything bought or paid for from 20 July morning to 19 August evening.</value>
            <value form="markdown">Past 30 days means the month before today. If today is 20 August, that means anything bought or paid for from 20 July morning to 19 August evening.</value>
          </text>
          <text id="assets-label">
            <value>**Things the household owns**

Count only items the household owns AND that are in good working condition.</value>
            <value form="markdown">**Things the household owns**

Count only items the household owns AND that are in good working condition.</value>
          </text>
          <text id="assets-sofa-label">
            <value>Does your household own a sofa?</value>
            <value form="markdown">Does your household own a sofa?</value>
          </text>
          <text id="assets-sofa-help">
            <value>The official Interview Guidance defines this asset as a 3 or 4 piece sofa set. Count only items in good working condition.</value>
            <value form="markdown">The official Interview Guidance defines this asset as a 3 or 4 piece sofa set. Count only items in good working condition.</value>
          </text>
          <text id="assets-fan-label">
            <value>Does your household own an FAN?</value>
            <value form="markdown">Does your household own an FAN?</value>
          </text>
          <text id="assets-fan-help">
            <value>Count only items in good working condition.</value>
            <value form="markdown">Count only items in good working condition.</value>
          </text>
          <text id="assets-fan-opt0-label">
            <value>Yes</value>
            <value form="markdown">Yes</value>
          </text>
          <text id="assets-fan-opt1-label">
            <value>No</value>
            <value form="markdown">No</value>
          </text>
          <text id="assets-iron-label">
            <value>Does your household own an IRON?</value>
            <value form="markdown">Does your household own an IRON?</value>
          </text>
        </translation>
      </itext>
      <bind nodeset="/data/case/@date_modified" type="xsd:dateTime" calculate="/data/meta/timeEnd"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/case/@user_id" calculate="/data/meta/userID"/>
      <setvalue ref="/data/case/@case_id" value="instance('commcaresession')/session/data/case_id_new_household_visit_0" event="xforms-ready"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/case/create/case_name" calculate="/data/entity_label"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/case/create/owner_id" calculate="/data/meta/userID"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/case/update/area_code" calculate="/data/arrival/area_code" relevant="count(/data/arrival/area_code) &gt; 0"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/case/update/gps" calculate="/data/arrival/gps" relevant="count(/data/arrival/gps) &gt; 0"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/case/update/gps_accuracy_m" calculate="/data/gps_accuracy_m" relevant="count(/data/gps_accuracy_m) &gt; 0"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/case/update/household_head_name" calculate="/data/identity/household_head_name" relevant="count(/data/identity/household_head_name) &gt; 0"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/case/update/poverty_likelihood" calculate="/data/poverty_likelihood" relevant="count(/data/poverty_likelihood) &gt; 0"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/case/update/ppi_score_clamped" calculate="/data/ppi_score_clamped" relevant="count(/data/ppi_score_clamped) &gt; 0"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/case/update/visit_date" calculate="/data/visit_date" relevant="count(/data/visit_date) &gt; 0"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/case/update/visit_outcome" calculate="/data/visit_outcome" relevant="count(/data/visit_outcome) &gt; 0"/>
      <setvalue ref="/data/meta/deviceID" value="instance('commcaresession')/session/context/deviceid" event="xforms-ready"/>
      <setvalue ref="/data/meta/timeStart" value="now()" event="xforms-ready"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/meta/timeStart" type="xsd:dateTime"/>
      <setvalue ref="/data/meta/timeEnd" value="now()" event="xforms-revalidate"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/meta/timeEnd" type="xsd:dateTime"/>
      <setvalue ref="/data/meta/username" value="instance('commcaresession')/session/context/username" event="xforms-ready"/>
      <setvalue ref="/data/meta/userID" value="instance('commcaresession')/session/context/userid" event="xforms-ready"/>
      <setvalue ref="/data/meta/instanceID" value="uuid()" event="xforms-ready"/>
      <setvalue ref="/data/meta/appVersion" value="instance('commcaresession')/session/context/appversion" event="xforms-ready"/>
      <setvalue ref="/data/meta/drift" value="if(count(instance('commcaresession')/session/context/drift) = 1, instance('commcaresession')/session/context/drift, '')" event="xforms-revalidate"/>
      <orx:pollsensor event="xforms-ready" ref="/data/meta/location"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/meta/location" type="geopoint"/>
    </model>
  </h:head>
  <h:body>
    <group ref="/data/arrival" appearance="field-list">
      <label ref="jr:itext('arrival-label')"/>
      <input ref="/data/arrival/area_code">
        <label ref="jr:itext('arrival-area_code-label')"/>
        <hint ref="jr:itext('arrival-area_code-hint')"/>
      </input>
      <input ref="/data/arrival/gps">
        <label ref="jr:itext('arrival-gps-label')"/>
        <hint ref="jr:itext('arrival-gps-hint')"/>
      </input>
      <trigger ref="/data/arrival/gps_advisory_good" appearance="minimal">
        <label ref="jr:itext('arrival-gps_advisory_good-label')"/>
      </trigger>
      <trigger ref="/data/arrival/gps_advisory_marginal" appearance="minimal">
        <label ref="jr:itext('arrival-gps_advisory_marginal-label')"/>
      </trigger>
      <trigger ref="/data/arrival/gps_advisory_poor" appearance="minimal">
        <label ref="jr:itext('arrival-gps_advisory_poor-label')"/>
      </trigger>
      <select1 ref="/data/arrival/zone">
        <label ref="jr:itext('arrival-zone-label')"/>
        <help ref="jr:itext('arrival-zone-help')"/>
        <item>
          <label ref="jr:itext('arrival-zone-opt0-label')"/>
          <value>north_central</value>
        </item>
        <item>
          <label ref="jr:itext('arrival-zone-opt1-label')"/>
          <value>north_east</value>
        </item>
        <item>
          <label ref="jr:itext('arrival-zone-opt2-label')"/>
          <value>north_west</value>
        </item>
        <item>
          <label ref="jr:itext('arrival-zone-opt3-label')"/>
          <value>south_east</value>
        </item>
        <item>
          <label ref="jr:itext('arrival-zone-opt4-label')"/>
          <value>south_south</value>
        </item>
        <item>
          <label ref="jr:itext('arrival-zone-opt5-label')"/>
          <value>south_west</value>
        </item>
      </select1>
    </group>
    <group ref="/data/door" appearance="field-list">
      <label ref="jr:itext('door-label')"/>
      <select1 ref="/data/door/occupied">
        <label ref="jr:itext('door-occupied-label')"/>
        <item>
          <label ref="jr:itext('assets-fan-opt0-label')"/>
          <value>yes</value>
        </item>
        <item>
          <label ref="jr:itext('assets-fan-opt1-label')"/>
          <value>no</value>
        </item>
      </select1>
    </group>
    <group ref="/data/respondent" appearance="field-list">
      <label ref="jr:itext('respondent-label')"/>
      <select1 ref="/data/respondent/eligible_respondent">
        <label ref="jr:itext('respondent-eligible_respondent-label')"/>
        <item>
          <label ref="jr:itext('assets-fan-opt0-label')"/>
          <value>yes</value>
        </item>
        <item>
          <label ref="jr:itext('assets-fan-opt1-label')"/>
          <value>no</value>
        </item>
      </select1>
    </group>
    <group ref="/data/consent_screen" appearance="field-list">
      <label ref="jr:itext('consent_screen-label')"/>
      <trigger ref="/data/consent_screen/consent_script" appearance="minimal">
        <label ref="jr:itext('consent_screen-consent_script-label')"/>
      </trigger>
      <select1 ref="/data/consent_screen/consent">
        <label ref="jr:itext('consent_screen-consent-label')"/>
        <item>
          <label ref="jr:itext('assets-fan-opt0-label')"/>
          <value>yes</value>
        </item>
        <item>
          <label ref="jr:itext('assets-fan-opt1-label')"/>
          <value>no</value>
        </item>
      </select1>
    </group>
    <group ref="/data/identity" appearance="field-list">
      <label ref="jr:itext('identity-label')"/>
      <input ref="/data/identity/respondent_name">
        <label ref="jr:itext('identity-respondent_name-label')"/>
      </input>
      <input ref="/data/identity/household_head_name">
        <label ref="jr:itext('identity-household_head_name-label')"/>
      </input>
      <input ref="/data/identity/phone">
        <label ref="jr:itext('identity-phone-label')"/>
      </input>
    </group>
    <group ref="/data/photo_screen" appearance="field-list">
      <label ref="jr:itext('photo_screen-label')"/>
      <upload ref="/data/photo_screen/dwelling_photo" mediatype="image/*">
        <label ref="jr:itext('photo_screen-dwelling_photo-label')"/>
      </upload>
    </group>
    <trigger ref="/data/roster_intro" appearance="minimal">
      <label ref="jr:itext('roster_intro-label')"/>
    </trigger>
    <group ref="/data/roster">
      <label ref="jr:itext('roster-label')"/>
      <repeat nodeset="/data/roster">
        <input ref="/data/roster/member_name">
          <label ref="jr:itext('roster-member_name-label')"/>
        </input>
        <select1 ref="/data/roster/is_member">
          <label ref="jr:itext('roster-is_member-label')"/>
          <help ref="jr:itext('roster-is_member-help')"/>
          <item>
            <label ref="jr:itext('assets-fan-opt0-label')"/>
            <value>yes</value>
          </item>
          <item>
            <label ref="jr:itext('assets-fan-opt1-label')"/>
            <value>no</value>
          </item>
        </select1>
      </repeat>
    </group>
    <select1 ref="/data/roster_gate">
      <label ref="jr:itext('roster_gate-label')"/>
      <item>
        <label ref="jr:itext('assets-fan-opt0-label')"/>
        <value>yes</value>
      </item>
      <item>
        <label ref="jr:itext('assets-fan-opt1-label')"/>
        <value>no</value>
      </item>
    </select1>
    <group ref="/data/consumption" appearance="field-list">
      <label ref="jr:itext('consumption-label')"/>
      <select1 ref="/data/consumption/bread">
        <label ref="jr:itext('consumption-bread-label')"/>
        <item>
          <label ref="jr:itext('assets-fan-opt0-label')"/>
          <value>yes</value>
        </item>
        <item>
          <label ref="jr:itext('assets-fan-opt1-label')"/>
          <value>no</value>
        </item>
      </select1>
      <select1 ref="/data/consumption/eggs">
        <label ref="jr:itext('consumption-eggs-label')"/>
        <item>
          <label ref="jr:itext('assets-fan-opt0-label')"/>
          <value>yes</value>
        </item>
        <item>
          <label ref="jr:itext('assets-fan-opt1-label')"/>
          <value>no</value>
        </item>
      </select1>
      <select1 ref="/data/consumption/milk">
        <label ref="jr:itext('consumption-milk-label')"/>
        <item>
          <label ref="jr:itext('assets-fan-opt0-label')"/>
          <value>yes</value>
        </item>
        <item>
          <label ref="jr:itext('assets-fan-opt1-label')"/>
          <value>no</value>
        </item>
      </select1>
      <select1 ref="/data/consumption/sachet_water">
        <label ref="jr:itext('consumption-sachet_water-label')"/>
        <item>
          <label ref="jr:itext('assets-fan-opt0-label')"/>
          <value>yes</value>
        </item>
        <item>
          <label ref="jr:itext('assets-fan-opt1-label')"/>
          <value>no</value>
        </item>
      </select1>
    </group>
    <group ref="/data/electricity_screen" appearance="field-list">
      <label ref="jr:itext('electricity_screen-label')"/>
      <select1 ref="/data/electricity_screen/electricity">
        <label ref="jr:itext('electricity_screen-electricity-label')"/>
        <help ref="jr:itext('electricity_screen-electricity-help')"/>
        <item>
          <label ref="jr:itext('assets-fan-opt0-label')"/>
          <value>yes</value>
        </item>
        <item>
          <label ref="jr:itext('assets-fan-opt1-label')"/>
          <value>no</value>
        </item>
      </select1>
    </group>
    <group ref="/data/assets" appearance="field-list">
      <label ref="jr:itext('assets-label')"/>
      <select1 ref="/data/assets/sofa">
        <label ref="jr:itext('assets-sofa-label')"/>
        <help ref="jr:itext('assets-sofa-help')"/>
        <item>
          <label ref="jr:itext('assets-fan-opt0-label')"/>
          <value>yes</value>
        </item>
        <item>
          <label ref="jr:itext('assets-fan-opt1-label')"/>
          <value>no</value>
        </item>
      </select1>
      <select1 ref="/data/assets/fan">
        <label ref="jr:itext('assets-fan-label')"/>
        <help ref="jr:itext('assets-fan-help')"/>
        <item>
          <label ref="jr:itext('assets-fan-opt0-label')"/>
          <value>yes</value>
        </item>
        <item>
          <label ref="jr:itext('assets-fan-opt1-label')"/>
          <value>no</value>
        </item>
      </select1>
      <select1 ref="/data/assets/iron">
        <label ref="jr:itext('assets-iron-label')"/>
        <help ref="jr:itext('assets-fan-help')"/>
        <item>
          <label ref="jr:itext('assets-fan-opt0-label')"/>
          <value>yes</value>
        </item>
        <item>
          <label ref="jr:itext('assets-fan-opt1-label')"/>
          <value>no</value>
        </item>
      </select1>
    </group>
  </h:body>
</h:html>